---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Claw · Assistant Architecture & Agent Core" description="Architecture, agent loop design, memory systems, and core specifications for OpenClaw.">
  <section class="section" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem;">
    <header class="section-header" style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted, #888); margin: 0;">System Architecture</p>
        <span style="font-size: 0.85rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem; background: rgba(50, 180, 100, 0.1); color: #2e8b57; border-radius: 99px; font-weight: 500;">Active Agent Core</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="display" style="font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem;">OpenClaw Architecture</h1>
      <p class="tagline" style="font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-secondary, #555);">Core runtime design, persistent memory layers, model routing tiers, and autonomous workflow capabilities.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- Visual Architecture Card -->
    <div style="margin: 2.5rem 0; padding: 2.5rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(240, 250, 245, 0.8) 0%, rgba(250, 255, 250, 0.95) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(46, 139, 87, 0.2); border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
      <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem;">
        <div>
          <h3 style="margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display, serif); font-size: 1.4rem; color: #1c4532;">OpenClaw Agent Core</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0.25rem 0 0 0; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #386641;">Autonomous Personal Assistant & Workspace Engine</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 0.75rem;">
          <span style="padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; background: #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: monospace;">Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite</span>
          <span style="padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem; background: #e2e8f0; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-family: monospace;">Code Mode</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Specs Grid -->
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="padding: 1.2rem; background: white; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Memory Tier</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">Daily Notes & MEMORY.md</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 1.2rem; background: white; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Spend Budget</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">$40/mo (Credit Pool)</div>
        </div>
        <div style="padding: 1.2rem; background: white; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;">
          <div style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #475569; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem;">Fallback Model</div>
          <div style="font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">Ollama Qwen 3.5:9b</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Detailed Prose Sections -->
    <div class="prose" style="margin-top: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-color, #eee); padding-bottom: 0.5rem;">Key Capabilities & Mechanics</h2>
      <ul style="line-height: 1.8;">
        <li><strong>Code Mode & Tooling:</strong> Executes robust JavaScript execution turns alongside first-class system tools for file operations, terminal actions, and automation management.</li>
        <li><strong>Context & Credit Hygiene:</strong> Optimized token-saver routing starting with <code>google/gemini-3.5-flash-lite</code> (~10× cheaper, ultra-fast latency) with automatic escalation and local fallback tiers.</li>
        <li><strong>Proactive Automations:</strong> Scheduled cron jobs and heartbeat routines for continuous background updates, email checks, and state maintenance.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
